= A Landmark Summer

In one week, a gunman murders nine people at a church in Charleston and the Supreme Court rules that same-sex couples have a constitutional right to marry. Grief and celebration share a news cycle.

- @unite: Speak to the moment, not the factions.
- @gun: Press for gun reform.

@unite
subtitle: Rare unity.
on-arrival: enthusiasm += 3; unity += 3; media_trust += 2

For a few days the country looks like it is speaking to itself.

@gun
subtitle: Base energized, rural voters wary.
on-arrival: enthusiasm += 4; mod_dissent += 3; pop_mod -= 0.1; far_right += 1

We say what many are thinking. We do not win the votes.
